{"seq":2,"slug":"unicode-encoding-normalization","title":"Unicode 编码与规范化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/unicode-encoding-normalization","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"unicode-编码与规范化\">Unicode 编码与规范化</h1><p>后端系统处理多语言文本时，Unicode 编码选择和规范化策略直接决定了数据一致性。同一个「可见字符」在 Unicode 中可能有多种字节表示——如果不在入口处统一规范化形式，下游的比较、索引、去重逻辑都会产生不可预期的结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>UTF-8 唯一性</strong>：后端全链路使用 UTF-8，MySQL 必须 <code>utf8mb4</code> 而非残缺的 <code>utf8</code></li>\n<li><strong>NFC 规范化</strong>：在系统入口处统一执行 NFC 规范化，内部一切假设 NFC</li>\n<li><strong>边界转换原则</strong>：编码转换只在与遗留系统交互的 adapter 层进行，核心永远 UTF-8</li>\n<li><strong>字素簇计量</strong>：用户可见长度用 grapheme cluster 计数，而非字节或码点</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"utf-8-作为后端统一编码\">UTF-8 作为后端统一编码</h2><p>2026 年，UTF-8 已覆盖超过 98% 的 Web 流量。后端系统选择 UTF-8 作为唯一内部编码不再是建议，而是工程共识。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码</th>\n<th>单字符字节数</th>\n<th>ASCII 兼容</th>\n<th>自同步</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UTF-8</td>\n<td>1-4</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>网络传输、存储、API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTF-16</td>\n<td>2-4</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Java/JS 运行时内部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTF-32</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需要 O(1) 码点索引时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Latin-1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>遗留系统兼容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>UTF-8 的自同步性质在后端场景中至关重要：任何字节序列中，从任意位置开始都能找到下一个合法字符边界。这意味着日志截断、分页切割、流式传输时不会产生无效序列——只要不在多字节序列中间切断。</p>\n<p>数据库层面的配置要点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- PostgreSQL：database 级别 + column 级别都要确认&#10;CREATE DATABASE app WITH ENCODING &#39;UTF8&#39; LC_COLLATE &#39;und-x-icu&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- MySQL 8.0+：使用 utf8mb4（真正的 UTF-8，而非残缺的 utf8/utf8mb3）&#10;CREATE TABLE messages (&#10;  id BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  content TEXT CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PostgreSQL：database 级别 + column 级别都要确认</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATABASE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ENCODING</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'UTF8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LC_COLLATE </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'und-x-icu'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- MySQL 8.0+：使用 utf8mb4（真正的 UTF-8，而非残缺的 utf8/utf8mb3）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHARACTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> utf8mb4 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COLLATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> utf8mb4_unicode_ci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MySQL 历史遗留的 <code>utf8</code> 只支持 BMP（最多 3 字节），无法存储 emoji 和部分 CJK 扩展字符。<code>utf8mb4</code> 才是完整的 UTF-8 实现。这个命名混乱已经导致无数生产事故——emoji 被静默截断、插入时报 <code>Incorrect string value</code> 错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四种规范化形式\">四种规范化形式</h2><p>Unicode 规范化解决的核心问题：相同「视觉字符」的不同编码序列必须被系统视为等价。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NFC</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>NFC</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mo>≡</mo><mtext>canonical</mtext></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NFC}(s_1) = \\text{NFC}(s_2) \\iff s_1 \\equiv_{\\text{canonical}} s_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NFC</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NFC</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6138em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\">≡</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">canonical</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;é (U+00E9)&lt;br/&gt;预组合形式&quot;] --&gt;|NFD 分解| B[&quot;e (U+0065) + ◌́ (U+0301)&lt;br/&gt;分解形式&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|NFC 组合| A&#10;    C[&quot;ﬁ (U+FB01)&lt;br/&gt;兼容字符&quot;] --&gt;|NFKD 分解| D[&quot;f (U+0066) + i (U+0069)&lt;br/&gt;兼容分解&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|NFKC 组合| E[&quot;fi&lt;br/&gt;规范组合&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"é (U+00E9)&lt;br/&gt;预组合形式\"] --&gt;|NFD 分解| B[\"e (U+0065) + ◌́ (U+0301)&lt;br/&gt;分解形式\"]\n    B --&gt;|NFC 组合| A\n    C[\"ﬁ (U+FB01)&lt;br/&gt;兼容字符\"] --&gt;|NFKD 分解| D[\"f (U+0066) + i (U+0069)&lt;br/&gt;兼容分解\"]\n    D --&gt;|NFKC 组合| E[\"fi&lt;br/&gt;规范组合\"]</pre><p>四种形式的工程选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>后端典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NFC</td>\n<td>规范分解 → 规范组合</td>\n<td><strong>默认选择</strong>：存储、API 输入输出、数据库索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NFD</td>\n<td>规范分解</td>\n<td>需要逐字符操作（如音调标记提取）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NFKC</td>\n<td>兼容分解 → 规范组合</td>\n<td>搜索索引、用户名规范化、去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NFKD</td>\n<td>兼容分解</td>\n<td>文本分析预处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>后端首选 NFC 的理由</strong>：W3C 规定所有 Web 内容应使用 NFC；大多数输入法产出 NFC 文本；NFC 字符串通常比 NFD 更短（欧洲语言中重音字符组合为单码点）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"后端规范化策略-边界处一次性转换\">后端规范化策略：边界处一次性转换</h2><p>规范化应在系统边界执行一次，而非散布在业务逻辑中多次调用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Input Boundary&#10;        A[HTTP Request Body] --&gt; B[Validation Layer]&#10;        B --&gt; C[NFC Normalize]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Core&#10;        C --&gt; D[Business Logic&lt;br/&gt;assumes NFC]&#10;        D --&gt; E[Database&lt;br/&gt;stores NFC]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Output Boundary&#10;        E --&gt; F[Serialization&lt;br/&gt;outputs NFC]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Input Boundary\n        A[HTTP Request Body] --&gt; B[Validation Layer]\n        B --&gt; C[NFC Normalize]\n    end\n    subgraph Core\n        C --&gt; D[Business Logic&lt;br/&gt;assumes NFC]\n        D --&gt; E[Database&lt;br/&gt;stores NFC]\n    end\n    subgraph Output Boundary\n        E --&gt; F[Serialization&lt;br/&gt;outputs NFC]\n    end</pre><p>实现要点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go 后端的输入规范化中间件&#10;import &quot;golang.org/x/text/unicode/norm&quot;&#10;&#10;func NormalizeMiddleware(next http.Handler) http.Handler {&#10;    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {&#10;        body, _ := io.ReadAll(r.Body)&#10;        normalized := norm.NFC.Bytes(body)&#10;        r.Body = io.NopCloser(bytes.NewReader(normalized))&#10;        next.ServeHTTP(w, r)&#10;    })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go 后端的输入规范化中间件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">golang.org/x/text/unicode/norm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NormalizeMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HandlerFunc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">w</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ResponseWriter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        body, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReadAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r.Body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        normalized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> norm.NFC.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Bytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        r.Body </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> io.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NopCloser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NewReader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(normalized))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        next.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ServeHTTP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, r)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ICU4X 2.2 提供了 <code>icu_normalizer</code> crate，性能基准测试显示其 NFC 规范化吞吐量比 ICU4C 高约 15%，且内存安全由 Rust 编译器保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范化与数据库索引的交互\">规范化与数据库索引的交互</h2><p>未规范化的文本进入数据库后，索引行为会变得不可预测：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>NFC 存储</th>\n<th>混合存储（未规范化）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确匹配 <code>WHERE name = &#39;café&#39;</code></td>\n<td>确定性命中</td>\n<td>可能漏匹配（NFD 的 <code>cafe\\u0301</code> 不等于 NFC 的 <code>café</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UNIQUE 约束</td>\n<td>正确去重</td>\n<td>同一用户名创建两个账号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B-tree 范围查询</td>\n<td>排序一致</td>\n<td>分解形式和预组合形式排序位置不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全文搜索</td>\n<td>分词器行为一致</td>\n<td>同一词的不同形式被视为不同 token</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>PostgreSQL 的 <code>ICU</code> collation provider（从 15 开始推荐）在比较时会做隐式规范化，但这不免除存储层的显式规范化——因为 <code>=</code> 和 <code>LIKE</code> 操作符使用的是字节级比较，不经过 collation。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全相关的规范化问题\">安全相关的规范化问题</h2><p>Unicode 规范化还是一个安全关切。攻击者利用视觉相似但编码不同的字符绕过校验：</p>\n<p><strong>同形攻击（Homograph Attack）</strong>：西里尔字母 <code>а</code>（U+0430）与拉丁字母 <code>a</code>（U+0061）视觉相同但字节不同。用户名 <code>admin</code> 和 <code>аdmin</code> 在未做 confusable 检测时会被视为两个不同用户。</p>\n<p><strong>不可见字符注入</strong>：零宽连接符（U+200D）、零宽非连接符（U+200C）、方向控制字符（U+202A-U+202E）可以插入用户输入中，绕过长度检查或改变显示方向。</p>\n<p>后端防御措施：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 用户名/标识符的安全规范化流程&#10;def sanitize_identifier(raw: str) -&gt; str:&#10;    # 1. NFKC 规范化（合并兼容字符）&#10;    normalized = unicodedata.normalize(&quot;NFKC&quot;, raw)&#10;    # 2. 移除不可见控制字符（保留空格和连字符）&#10;    stripped = &quot;&quot;.join(c for c in normalized&#10;                      if unicodedata.category(c) not in (&quot;Cf&quot;, &quot;Cc&quot;, &quot;Mn&quot;))&#10;    # 3. 转小写（locale 无关的 case folding）&#10;    folded = stripped.casefold()&#10;    return folded\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 用户名/标识符的安全规范化流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sanitize_identifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(raw: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 1. NFKC 规范化（合并兼容字符）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    normalized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unicodedata.normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NFKC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, raw)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 2. 移除不可见控制字符（保留空格和连字符）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stripped </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalized</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unicodedata.category(c) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Cf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Cc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Mn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 3. 转小写（locale 无关的 case folding）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    folded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stripped.casefold()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> folded</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ICU 提供 <code>SpoofChecker</code> API 用于检测 confusable 字符——对于用户名、域名等安全敏感字段，应在 NFKC 规范化之外额外启用 confusable 检测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字符串长度的语义差异\">字符串长度的语义差异</h2><p>后端代码中 <code>len(s)</code> 的含义随语言和编码而变，这在校验（如「用户名最多 20 个字符」）时经常出错：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言/API</th>\n<th><code>len(&quot;café&quot;)</code></th>\n<th>计量单位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Go <code>len()</code></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go <code>utf8.RuneCountInString()</code></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>码点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java <code>String.length()</code></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>UTF-16 code unit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python <code>len()</code></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>码点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户感知 &quot;🇯🇵&quot;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>字素簇（grapheme cluster）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于用户可见的长度限制，正确的计量单位是<strong>字素簇</strong>（grapheme cluster），而非码点或字节。一个 emoji 旗帜序列 &quot;🇯🇵&quot; 由两个码点组成（U+1F1EF + U+1F1F5），但用户视为一个字符。</p>\n<p>ICU4X 的 <code>icu_segmenter</code> 提供 grapheme cluster 分割，可用于后端的输入校验：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>user_length</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>grapheme_clusters</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mtext>max_allowed</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{user\\_length}(s) = |\\text{grapheme\\_clusters}(s)| \\leq \\text{max\\_allowed}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">user_length</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">grapheme_clusters</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max_allowed</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"编码转换的后端实践\">编码转换的后端实践</h2><p>遗留系统集成时不可避免地需要编码转换。关键原则：<strong>转换只在边界做，核心保持 UTF-8</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Legacy System&lt;br/&gt;Shift-JIS] --&gt;|iconv/ICU 转换| B[Adapter Layer]&#10;    B --&gt;|UTF-8 NFC| C[Core System]&#10;    C --&gt;|UTF-8 NFC| D[Adapter Layer]&#10;    D --&gt;|iconv/ICU 转换| E[Legacy System&lt;br/&gt;GB2312]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Legacy System&lt;br/&gt;Shift-JIS] --&gt;|iconv/ICU 转换| B[Adapter Layer]\n    B --&gt;|UTF-8 NFC| C[Core System]\n    C --&gt;|UTF-8 NFC| D[Adapter Layer]\n    D --&gt;|iconv/ICU 转换| E[Legacy System&lt;br/&gt;GB2312]</pre><p>转换时必须处理的边界情况：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>不可映射字符</strong>：源编码存在但目标编码没有的字符。策略选择：替换为 <code>?</code> / 使用 HTML 实体 / 报错拒绝</li>\n<li><strong>半角/全角</strong>：日语系统中 <code>ﾊ</code>（半角片假名）和 <code>ハ</code>（全角片假名）的转换。NFKC 会将半角统一为全角</li>\n<li><strong>BOM 处理</strong>：UTF-8 BOM（EF BB BF）在从 Windows 系统接收文件时需要剥离，否则 JSON parser 报错</li>\n</ul>\n<p>转换操作本身有性能成本。对于高吞吐量场景，在<a href=\"../operations/i18n-performance-caching\">国际化性能与缓存</a>中讨论了批量转换和缓存策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Unicode 编码与规范化是后端 i18n 的地基。UTF-8 作为唯一内部编码消除了编码转换的复杂度；NFC 规范化在入口处执行一次，确保下游所有比较、索引、去重操作的一致性；安全规范化（NFKC + confusable 检测）防止同形攻击和不可见字符注入。对长度限制使用 grapheme cluster 而非字节/码点计量，是让校验逻辑与用户感知一致的关键。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Unicode 编码与规范化","id":"unicode-编码与规范化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"UTF-8 作为后端统一编码","id":"utf-8-作为后端统一编码"},{"level":2,"text":"四种规范化形式","id":"四种规范化形式"},{"level":2,"text":"后端规范化策略：边界处一次性转换","id":"后端规范化策略-边界处一次性转换"},{"level":2,"text":"规范化与数据库索引的交互","id":"规范化与数据库索引的交互"},{"level":2,"text":"安全相关的规范化问题","id":"安全相关的规范化问题"},{"level":2,"text":"字符串长度的语义差异","id":"字符串长度的语义差异"},{"level":2,"text":"编码转换的后端实践","id":"编码转换的后端实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"国际化架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/i18n-architecture-patterns"},"next":{"title":"区域检测与内容协商","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/locale-detection-negotiation"}}